  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Actividad de coordinaci&#xf3;n de tecnolog&#xed;as agr&#xed;colas de escalamiento del FTF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FTF Scaling Agriculture Technologies Coordination Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El prop&#xf3;sito de esta actividad de cinco a&#xf1;os de coordinaci&#xf3;n de tecnolog&#xed;as agr&#xed;colas de escalamiento de Feed the Future Guatemala, estimada en $6 millones, es fortalecer las entidades de investigaci&#xf3;n, educaci&#xf3;n y extensi&#xf3;n existentes en Guatemala.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this five year, estimated $6 million Feed the Future Guatemala Scaling Agriculture Technologies Coordination activity is to strengthen existing research, education and outreach entities in Guatemala.</narrative>
  </description>
